    "notes": "All 12 views inspected. Firefighter in black turnout gear with correctly placed retroreflective yellow banding on the chest, cuffs, thighs and ankles, a red helmet with a raised visor, gloves, harness straps with buckles and a back-mounted air cylinder with a regulator. The banding wraps continuously around the limbs in every side and rear view and the cylinder bracket is complete at the back. No legible service name, badge number or manufacturer mark appears anywhere. Rigged: 54-bone humanoid armature (24 body + 30 finger bones), walk and run clips, zero unweighted skinned vertices.",
    "limitations": [
      "AI-assisted origin is disclosed upstream (origin.ai_content); some storefronts require an AI-content disclosure when you resell.",
      "The visor is modelled in the raised position only and is not a separate hinged part.",
      "The air cylinder cannot be removed."
    ],
